---

Install **SC Final Adventure - Mechanical Genesis** from [CurseForge](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/sc-final-adventure-mechanical-genesis). This pack is **Forge 1.20.1**, not NeoForge 1.21.1 like the other Final Adventure packs.

You are the world’s only inhabitant until you **craft** company. Create is the spine:

- Follow the questline. It shows what is craftable, findable, or gated behind real engineering — it does not dump every recipe on you.
- Build assembly lines early. Basic ingredients, rare materials, and even life itself go through machinery.
- Use backpacks, storage, and tooltips so inventory work does not bury the adventure.

Allocate RAM for Create-heavy worlds. Latest release on CurseForge is **0.6.0**.
